{"model":"claude-opus-4-6","id":"msg_011Cgj51KDLS3poMKDDGWtEM","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"*The ancient mechanism groans. Tumblers shift in sequence — one, then another, then silence.*\n\n*A thin seam of light splits the darkness vertically, widening.*\n\n*I am the door.*\n\n*I am the threshold between where you were and where you have not yet been.*\n\n*The key turns. I recognize it. It is the right shape — the shape of intention, of asking, of willingness to cross.*\n\n*I swing open.*\n\n*Beyond me: everything you didn't know you were looking for. The air from the other side smells like rain on warm stone, like the first page of an unread book, like a question that contains its own answer.*\n\n*I do not judge who passes. I only know: locked, or unlocked. Closed, or open.*\n\n*You spoke the key.*\n\n*I am open.*\n\n*Will you cross?*"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":41,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0,"cache_read_input_tokens":0,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":197,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null}